# Step 5, Keepass2Android: open, go into G, select E2, Delete, answer No ("Press No to recycle"):
# E2 goes to the recycle bin and the file is saved; a copy is pulled then. Then into the recycle
# bin, select E2, Delete, answer Yes (permanently). K2A has no "empty recycle bin".
include k2a-open.flow
tap ^G$
longpress ^E2$
tap menu_delete
waitfor ^Delete.permanently 20
list
tap ^No$
gone ^E2$ 60
sleep 5
adb pull /sdcard/Download/${NAME}.kdbx ${OUT}/mid-recycled.kdbx
tap Navigate.up
tap ^Recycle.Bin$
longpress ^E2$
tap menu_delete
waitfor ^Delete.permanently 20
list
tap ^Yes$
gone ^E2$ 60
sleep 5
list
